# Arena simulator

`npm run sim` is not in `web/package.json` yet. When it exists, automated checks and smoke tests stay at `--games 4` or fewer:

`npm run sim -- --games 4`

Do not run a 100-game (or larger) benchmark unattended.

AI planners and Monte Carlo workers use a deterministic Mulberry32 PRNG. Every command they emit goes through `validateCommand` before it is returned.
